{"asset_key":"mn/quest_story_11211760","episode":"mn","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11211760","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1121176001:1":{"text":"タ、タレン様！大丈夫ですか？","source_cn":"塔、塔琳殿下！你没事吗？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9DC09BFA225AB7A4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1121176002:1":{"text":"……ぜ、全部思い出したわ。私が誰なのかも、過去も、そして記憶を失った理由も……","source_cn":"……我，全都想起来了。身份，过去，还有我会失去记忆的原因……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x61F42ADABD487832","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1121176003:2":{"text":"私が追っていたカタストロフは、異空間に隠れるのが得意だった。そして、私は交戦中に相手の魔法を受けて……<style=\"highlight\">複製体</style>が生まれた。","source_cn":"我之前追击的那个恶魔，善于躲进另一个空间中。交手时，我...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC588C1A9415EF91C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1121176004:1":{"text":"いいえ、複製というよりも、それは<style=\"highlight\">均等と対称</style>の力……","source_cn":"比起复制，他的力量，更像是<style=highlig...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF4BA4330244D5525","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1121176005:1":{"text":"でも、神より賜った力は奪えなかったから……私はセレスチアルの力を持ったまま、記憶だけを失った。","source_cn":"但是，只有神明赐予的力量，他无法夺走。所以我只是失去了...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x69A110C3E3E4ED80","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_inde